| Layer | Name         | Function                                            | Example                           |
| ----- | ------------ | --------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| **7** | Application  | Provides network services to users and applications | HTTP, FTP, SMTP                   |
| **6** | Presentation | Translates, encrypts, and compresses data           | SSL/TLS, JPEG, ASCII              |
| **5** | Session      | Establishes, manages, and terminates sessions       | NetBIOS, RPC                      |
| **4** | Transport    | Ensures reliable data transfer and error recovery   | TCP, UDP                          |
| **3** | Network      | Determines routing and logical addressing           | IP, ICMP, Routers                 |
| **2** | Data Link    | Handles physical addressing and error detection     | Ethernet, MAC addresses, Switches |
| **1** | Physical     | Transmits raw bits over a medium                    | Cables, Fiber Optics, Hubs        |

